<view class="page page-plain settings-page motion-page">
  <view class="settings-intro motion-section">个人资料与数据同步</view>
  <view class="card motion-section">
    <view class="card-head-title">个人资料</view>
    <view class="settings-profile"><profile-fill mode="edit" /></view>
    <view class="settings-hint">点击头像更换，昵称编辑完成后自动保存。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="card motion-section">
    <view class="card-head-title">同步与存储</view>
    <view class="row">
      <view class="row-main">
        <view class="row-title">{{cloudOn ? '云端同步' : '本地存储'}}</view>
        <view class="row-sub settings-status">{{syncText}}</view>
      </view>
      <button wx:if="{{cloudOn}}" class="btn-ghost sync-button" loading="{{syncing}}" disabled="{{syncing}}" bindtap="syncNow">{{syncing ? '同步中' : '立即同步'}}</button>
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <view class="row-main"><view class="row-title">本机数据</view><view class="row-sub">{{ledgerCount}} 个账本 · {{recordCount}} 笔记录</view></view>
    </view>
    <view class="settings-note">{{cloudOn ? '记账先保存在本机，再同步到当前配置的服务器。断网时仍可记账，联网后自动重试。' : '记录保存在当前设备，请及时导出备份。'}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="card motion-section">
    <view class="card-head-title">数据管理</view>
    <view class="row settings-link" role="button" aria-label="打开账单回收站" bindtap="goRecycle" hover-class="press-soft">
      <view class="row-main"><view class="row-title">账单回收站</view><view class="row-sub">{{deletedCount ? deletedCount + ' 笔已删除账单，可逐笔恢复' : '找回误删账单，恢复到原账本'}}</view></view>
      <text class="settings-chevron">›</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="card motion-section">
    <view class="card-head-title">账本移除说明</view>
    <view class="settings-note">在「我的 → 账本管理」删除账本。开启云同步时，同账号其他设备也会移除，其他成员的账本不受影响。</view>
    <view class="settings-note">删除最后一个账本后，会保留一个空白账本供你继续记账。新设备登录会优先恢复已有账本。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="settings-footer">记账本 · v1.1.4</view>
</view>
